This product ships, in its container image, third-party components under
their own licenses. They are listed below. The license texts travel with the
components: in the image under /app/.venv/lib/python3.13/site-packages/
*.dist-info/ (Python packages), /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright (Debian
packages), next to the browser in /opt/playwright-browsers and, for the
driver of playwright, in .../site-packages/playwright/driver.

Licenses were read from the installed package metadata (uv.lock, 2026-11-14)
where available; entries marked "upstream" could not be read locally and are
taken from the project's own declaration - check them in the built image.


